@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Create an order (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalReference": "PO-2026-00123",
  "customerName": "Acme Corp",
  "customerCode": "ACME-001",
  "currency": "ZAR",
  "notes": "Deliver before month end",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "SKU-A", "name": "Product A", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 100.00 },
    { "sku": "SKU-B", "name": "Product B", "quantity": 3, "unitPrice": 50.00 }
  ]
}

### Repeat the same order (200 OK — idempotent replay, same order ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalReference": "PO-2026-00123",
  "customerName": "Acme Corp",
  "currency": "ZAR",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "SKU-A", "name": "Product A", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 100.00 }
  ]
}

### Validation failure (400 VALIDATION_FAILED — multiple field errors)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalReference": "",
  "customerName": "",
  "currency": "XXX1",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "", "name": "Product A", "quantity": 0, "unitPrice": -1 }
  ]
}

### List orders (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders?page=1&pageSize=20

### List orders filtered by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders?status=Pending

### Get order by ID (replace with a real ID from a create response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Get order with malformed ID (404 ORDER_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/not-a-guid

### Confirm an order (replace with a real ID)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Confirmed" }

### Invalid transition (409 INVALID_STATUS_TRANSITION — e.g. Pending → Fulfilled)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Fulfilled" }

### Unknown status value (400 VALIDATION_FAILED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Shipped" }
